{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-019",
    "title": "引灯人现身"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_101",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆照临问：“你离开那天，给我留下了什么？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "黑铁门开启后，城心没有亮起来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3075,
          "end": 3075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内是一座向下延伸的石厅，墙壁上嵌着数百枚灰白石片。石片大小不一，有的刻着名字，有的只剩一道被磨平的凹痕。每隔十步便有一根灯柱，灯柱没有灯火，却在柱身内部流动着青色的光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3077,
          "end": 3077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在第一根灯柱旁，盯着上面新出现的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3079,
          "end": 3079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“被填入裂口的记忆，不能再回到原来的主人身上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3105,
          "end": 3105
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向他：“那被删去的年代，就是真的发生过，只是没人能完整记得？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3107,
          "end": 3107
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是没人。”慧闻说，“是记得的人无法同时证明。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3109,
          "end": 3109
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅深处传来一声轻响。陆照临掌心的残印沿着地面白光移动，停在一枚裂开的石片前。石片上只剩半行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3111,
          "end": 3111
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“冬至前七日，三名引灯人入城，携第二盏……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3113,
          "end": 3113
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后半行被削掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3115,
          "end": 3115
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二盏灯后来去了哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3117,
          "end": 3117
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向顾长离：“有人把它送回了人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3119,
          "end": 3119
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3121,
          "end": 3121
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支的一名经手人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3123,
          "end": 3123
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的手指缓慢收紧：“我叔父？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3125,
          "end": 3125
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叔父不是修士，却最擅长记账。他把每一盏灯的去向写在账上，直到有人要求他把自己的名字也写进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3127,
          "end": 3127
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他答应了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3129,
          "end": 3129
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他拒绝了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3131,
          "end": 3131
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“然后呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3133,
          "end": 3133
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻没有回答。无相铜镜中，一段新的影像浮出：一个佩着顾氏铜环的男人站在城心，手里捧着第二盏灯。他将灯交给一名白发老妇，又把一枚铜环埋入土中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3135,
          "end": 3135
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人转身时，脸已经变得模糊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3137,
          "end": 3137
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离向前一步：“他还活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3139,
          "end": 3139
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“影像不能证明活着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3141,
          "end": 3141
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可他把灯送回了无灯镇。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3143,
          "end": 3143
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“送灯的人，不一定能回到送灯的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3145,
          "end": 3145
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石厅两侧的灯柱同时亮起。青光照出墙上被削平的名字，其中一枚石片上浮现出“沈”字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3147,
          "end": 3147
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想起沈砚秋袖口那半页写着“引灯”的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3149,
          "end": 3149
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗也有人参与？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3151,
          "end": 3151
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三方共同封存。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3153,
          "end": 3153
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁是玄霄宗那个人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3155,
          "end": 3155
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他后来成为外门执事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3157,
          "end": 3157
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜转头看陆照临：“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3159,
          "end": 3159
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷声道：“她到底删掉了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3161,
          "end": 3161
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻将铜镜对准陆照临。镜中没有出现他的脸，只出现一片雪地。雪地中央站着年幼的陆照临，身旁是陆沉舟。陆沉舟手里没有灯，只有一块灰白石片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3163,
          "end": 3163
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这不可能。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3165,
          "end": 3165
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3167,
          "end": 3167
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲离开时，我已经十几岁。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3169,
          "end": 3169
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆可以被提前修改。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3171,
          "end": 3171
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁修改的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3173,
          "end": 3173
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻收回铜镜：“不是谁，是秩序。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3175,
          "end": 3175
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临感到额角发疼。雪地影像里，陆沉舟正把石片按进他的胸口。年幼的自己没有反抗，反而抬头问了一句什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3177,
          "end": 3177
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影像无声，只有唇形清晰可辨：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3179,
          "end": 3179
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我会忘记你吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3181,
          "end": 3181
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临踉跄后退，撞上灯柱。掌心残印骤然发热，一段陌生记忆从脑海深处浮出：北河城老槐树下，陆沉舟教他辨认三种灯火。第一种照路，第二种照人，第三种照回不去的地方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3183,
          "end": 3183
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他想起了树冠的方向。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3185,
          "end": 3185
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "也想起父亲最后一次离开时，穿的是一件灰色旧斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3187,
          "end": 3187
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "下一瞬，记忆又像潮水退去，只留下模糊轮廓。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3189,
          "end": 3189
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见了。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3191,
          "end": 3191
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我看见的是真的吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3193,
          "end": 3193
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“真实和记得，不是同一件事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3195,
          "end": 3195
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜走到石厅中央，指向墙上最完整的一枚石片：“这里写着太虚秩序的条件。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3197,
          "end": 3197
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石片上的字逐渐清晰：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3199,
          "end": 3199
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若要修补灵脉，须有一人自愿交出真名；若无人自愿，则由秩序择取。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3201,
          "end": 3201
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离盯着最后四个字，脸色发白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3203,
          "end": 3203
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一次。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3229,
          "end": 3229
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两次。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3231,
          "end": 3231
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "未灭。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3267,
          "end": 3267
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这一次，声音里有明显的疲惫。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3285,
          "end": 3285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临握紧半枚残印：“你是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3287,
          "end": 3287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内沉默了很久。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3289,
          "end": 3289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3291,
          "end": 3291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你记得北河城吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3293,
          "end": 3293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3295,
          "end": 3295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门口的老槐树呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3297,
          "end": 3297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“树冠朝南，枝干中间有一道雷劈的疤。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3299,
          "end": 3299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临的呼吸停住了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3301,
          "end": 3301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这是他刚刚想起，又差点再次失去的细节。若门内的声音知道它，便可能真是陆沉舟；可太虚遗脉能够借用被夺走的记忆，这个答案仍不足以证明身份。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3303,
          "end": 3303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离低声道：“问他只有你们知道的事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3305,
          "end": 3305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“你离开那天，给我留下了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3307,
          "end": 3307
        }
      }
    ],
